{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"凝聚理论"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"凝聚理论"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"逻辑","text":"逻辑"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>凝聚理论是只使用如下符号的"},{"Local":{"url":"一阶语言","text":"一阶理论"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有限合取 (conjunction) $\\land$, $\\bot$,</li>\n<li>有限析取 (disjunction) $\\lor$, $\\top$,</li>\n<li>存在量词 $\\exists$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>凝聚理论的"},{"Local":{"url":"分类意象","text":"分类意象"}},{"Plain":" (即"},{"Local":{"url":"语法范畴","text":"语法景"}},{"Plain":"上的"},{"Local":{"url":"层范畴","text":"层范畴"}},{"Plain":") 是"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚意象","text":"凝聚意象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>局部环</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"局部环","text":"局部环"}},{"Plain":"的理论是环的理论加上如下公理, 从而是凝聚理论:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$0 = 1 \\vdash \\bot$,</li>\n<li>$x+y=1 \\vdash \\exists z (xz=1)\\lor (yz=1)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>既约环</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"既约环","text":"既约环"}},{"Plain":"的理论也是凝聚理论, 因为其公理可写成 $x^2=0 \\vdash x=0$.</p>\n"}]}}